{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738650/extras/e0a68864438d6795229288424bdbdb10.poster.avif?t=1763539160\" width=948 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738650/extras/e0a68864438d6795229288424bdbdb10.webm?t=1763539160\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738650/extras/e0a68864438d6795229288424bdbdb10.mp4?t=1763539160\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738650/extras/5930c49c7491c50b7778b8694df990af.poster.avif?t=1763539160\" width=720 height=58 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738650/extras/5930c49c7491c50b7778b8694df990af.webm?t=1763539160\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738650/extras/5930c49c7491c50b7778b8694df990af.mp4?t=1763539160\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>\u2502 Ants. One of the most organized species on the planet.<br>\u2502 Their colonies are cities. Their trails are highways.<br>\u2502 Their goal is survival. And every movement has purpose.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738650/extras/85ae606c07da6ed66c5bbb8fe92d3930.poster.avif?t=1763539160\" width=462 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738650/extras/85ae606c07da6ed66c5bbb8fe92d3930.webm?t=1763539160\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738650/extras/85ae606c07da6ed66c5bbb8fe92d3930.mp4?t=1763539160\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Soilborn: Ant Empire</strong>, you observe and guide an ant colony as it gathers food, builds its nest, and defends against natural threats.<br>This is not fantasy. It's a living system \u2014 recreated with care and based on real biological behavior.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ants collect food to spawn new workers.<br>They carry wood scraps to expand the nest.<br>They respond instinctively to threats \u2014 especially when a predator bird arrives.<br>If enough ants fight back, the bird retreats. If not, the colony suffers losses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The sound design takes inspiration from nature documentaries \u2014<br>no music, no drama, only detail.<br>You hear rustling leaves.<br>Snapping twigs.<br>Tiny footsteps on the forest floor.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738650/extras/699e12862c857d4332f7923afdd4184d.poster.avif?t=1763539160\" width=300 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738650/extras/699e12862c857d4332f7923afdd4184d.webm?t=1763539160\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738650/extras/699e12862c857d4332f7923afdd4184d.mp4?t=1763539160\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2502 This is not fiction.<br>\u2502 This is nature, uninterrupted.<br>\u2502 It doesn\u2019t need story.<br>\u2502 It already has one.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3738650?t=1763539160","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738650/e28f6df79331f616abe75f06bc80c240f5d0d90b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1763539160","capsule_image":